## 🎯 Services Implémentés

### Services Obligatoires (3/3)

| # | Service | Port | Status | Détails |
|---|---------|------|--------|---------|
| 1 | **NGINX** | 443 | ✅ | SSL/TLS 1.2/1.3, Reverse proxy |
| 2 | **WordPress** | 9000 | ✅ | PHP-FPM 7.4, WP-CLI, 2 users |
| 3 | **MariaDB** | 3306 | ✅ | MySQL, 2 users (root + wpuser) |

### Services Bonus (5/5)

| # | Service | Port(s) | Status | Utilité |
|---|---------|---------|--------|---------|
| 1 | **Redis** | 6379 | ⭐ | Cache WordPress, améliore performances |
| 2 | **FTP** | 21, 21000-21010 | ⭐ | Accès FTP au volume WordPress |
| 3 | **Site Statique** | 8081 | ⭐ | Portfolio HTML/CSS/JS |
| 4 | **Adminer** | 8080 | ⭐ | Interface MySQL/MariaDB |
| 5 | **Portainer** | 9000 | ⭐ | Interface de gestion Docker |

