## ⚡ Commandes Principales

```bash
# Installation
make                    # Build et start tout
./check.sh              # Vérifier installation

# Gestion
make up                 # Start
make down               # Stop
make status             # État
make logs               # Logs temps réel

# Nettoyage
make clean              # Containers/networks
make fclean             # Tout supprimer
make re                 # Rebuild complet
```

